OL,3,AHow Canada could hit back to hurt the
OL,4,AUS economy - and Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 70% of Canada's exported goods go
OL,7,Fto the US. So what leverage does it
OL,8,Fhave in this spiralling trade dispute
OL,9,Fwith its southern neighbour, which also
OL,10,Fhappens to be the world's largest
OL,11,Feconomy?
OL,13,FCanada is the top customer for 26 US
OL,14,Fstates, including Maine, Michigan, and
OL,15,FWisconsin. And it is in the top three
OL,16,Ffor 45 of the 50 American states,
OL,17,Fsuggesting Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,18,Fhas room to manoeuvre in a trade fight.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
