OL,3,AHow Canada could hit back to hurt the
OL,4,AUS economy - and Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor now, Carney's planned Canadian
OL,7,Fretaliatory duties are strategic
OL,8,F"dollar-for-dollar" countermeasures
OL,9,Ffocused on steel, dairy, appliances,
OL,10,Fagricultural equipment, electronics,
OL,11,Fpulp and paper - though the list is
OL,12,Fstill being finalised.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
