OL,3,AHow Canada could hit back to hurt the
OL,4,AUS economy - and Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolls suggest a majority of Canadians
OL,7,Fwould be unhappy if his government went
OL,8,Fin the other direction and made
OL,9,Fsignificant concessions to the US. That
OL,10,Fsentiment is shared by Ontario Premier
OL,11,FDoug Ford, one of Trump's most vocal
OL,12,Fcritics north of the border, who
OL,13,Fresponded to the tariff threats by
OL,14,Ftelling the US president to "kiss my
OL,15,Fass".
